1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,720
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,760
=Episode 1=

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,720
(The Battle for Favor)

4
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:19,120
(Great Liang, 9th Year of Yongqing)

5
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,320
(As a poem goes,)

6
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,440
(Spared the palace,
yet honored like a Jinshi;)

7
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,680
(Fu Rong, candidate for imperial harem)
(Flower in hair, you're free to marry.)

8
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:25,760
(Fu Rong)

9
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:26,760
(So,)

10
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:29,120
(Not every parent)

11
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,080
(wants their daughter in the palace)

12
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,080
(and bring honor to the family.)

13
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,520
(Unfortunately,)

14
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,720
(such loving parents)

15
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:39,720
(were never mine.)

16
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,840
The auspicious hour has come.

17
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:44,320
Line up, ladies, and hold your name tag.

18
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,920
Follow me into the palace.

19
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,080
Once you enter the inner palace,

20
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,320
you'll be serving His Majesty.

21
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,960
Here in the inner palace,

22
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,800
winning His Majesty's favor
is everything.

23
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,400
Have you all understood?

24
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,200
Thank you for the reminder, sir.

25
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,280
(I'm Fu Rong.)

26
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,960
(When I was 16,)

27
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,160
(my parents forced me
into the imperial selection,)

28
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:14,120
(telling me to win His Majesty's favor)

29
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:15,720
(to advance
my father and brothers' careers.)

30
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:17,760
(Everyone knows)

31
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:20,040
(once you're in,
there's no turning back.)

32
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,680
(In the inner palace,)

33
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,800
(how many women ever meet a happy end?)

34
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,640
(One year later)
(After a year in the palace,)

35
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,480
(By chance,
I caught His Majesty's favor)

36
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:31,360
(and gave birth to a daughter, Lingxi.)

37
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,640
(From then on,)

38
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:36,200
(I had someone in this world
bound to me by blood.)

39
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,520
(As for the glory my family seeks,)

40
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:40,520
(and the future they desire,)

41
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:43,240
(I'm afraid
I'll have to disappoint you.)

42
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,360
(I, Fu Rong,)

43
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,160
(will never play by your rules)

44
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:50,160
(and fight for favor.)

45
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:52,720
(All I want is for my daughter, Lingxi,)

46
00:01:53,400 --> 00:01:55,920
(Lingxi, Fu Rong's daughter)
(to live safe and sound.)

47
00:01:58,800 --> 00:01:59,600
Lingxi.

48
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,440
What's so special about
this piece of junk?

49
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:02,840
(Jinxuan, Zhaoyi Shen's daughter)
Let me have a look.

50
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,120
Jinxuan, please give it back.

51
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,600
I carved it for a long time.

52
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,320
It's a gift for Father.

53
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:17,160
You little mute want to please him?

54
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:21,600
Your Highness.

55
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,320
This is my wooden horse.

56
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,440
(Zhaoyi Shen)
Please give it back to me.

57
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:28,480
Mother.

58
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:31,320
What's so special about this junk wood?

59
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,440
Give it back to her.

60
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,720
Let her give it to Father.

61
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,040
That's hilarious!

62
00:02:35,040 --> 00:02:36,160
What a fool!

63
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:39,000
What do you know?

64
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,240
Guards.

65
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,280
Bring in the brazier.

66
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,200
Yes.

67
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,640
(If I ruin her hands,)

68
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:15,320
(she'll never paint or carve again,)

69
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,440
(nor competing with Jinxuan.)

70
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,960
Can't you see?

71
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:21,760
Princess Lingxi is taking her carving
out of the brazier.

72
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:22,800
Go help her.

73
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,800
Yes.

74
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:32,520
Stop it!

75
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,760
Stop it!

76
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,560
Lingxi!

77
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,240
How dare you!

78
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,040
You dare make a scene in my palace?

79
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,640
Zhaoyi Shen.

80
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,200
If you ever lay a finger
on my daughter again,

81
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:51,040
I'll pour this boiling water

82
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:53,200
right over your face!

83
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,720
Just hold on.

84
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:02,160
I've sent someone to fetch medicine.

85
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,640
Mother,

86
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,160
why did Zhaoyi Shen beat us?

87
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,920
Did I do something wrong?

88
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,000
We did nothing wrong.

89
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:23,040
Some people fawn over the powerful
and look down on the weak,

90
00:04:23,716 --> 00:04:25,676
They simply won't let us live in peace.

91
00:04:26,756 --> 00:04:28,356
(How can this vast inner palace)

92
00:04:29,076 --> 00:04:30,796
(have no place for a mute girl?)

93
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:42,120
Mother,

94
00:04:42,280 --> 00:04:44,800
I don't want them looking down on me.

95
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:48,160
And I don't want you to suffer anymore.

96
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,920
I...

97
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,840
I won't let you

98
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,160
to suffer anymore, either.

99
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:13,790
(Zhaoyi Shen,)

100
00:05:14,590 --> 00:05:16,310
(I, Fu Rong,
have always lived cautiously)

101
00:05:16,310 --> 00:05:18,270
(in the inner palace,)

102
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:20,350
(having to watch
every word and move I make.)

103
00:05:20,910 --> 00:05:23,110
(Because I never wanted
to compete for His Majesty's favor,)

104
00:05:23,390 --> 00:05:25,110
(nor to enter the harem's games.)

105
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:29,030
(But time and again,
you've bullied my child.)

106
00:05:30,230 --> 00:05:31,630
(You are truly...)

107
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:33,790
(Unforgivable.)

108
00:05:38,460 --> 00:05:39,500
Today is the spring equinox.

109
00:05:39,900 --> 00:05:41,060
Yang energy is returning,

110
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:42,260
and all things begin anew.

111
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:44,300
Princess Jinxuan has turned 10.

112
00:05:44,340 --> 00:05:45,260
(The Emperor)
She's bright and gifted,

113
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:46,500
Recently,

114
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:47,700
she completed several paintings

115
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:48,940
of remarkable detail.

116
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:50,100
My heart rejoices.

117
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:51,940
I've ordered the Imperial Household

118
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:53,020
to select a title for her

119
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:54,140
as a reward.

120
00:05:55,660 --> 00:05:57,300
- Thank you, Your Majesty!
- Thank you, Your Majesty!

121
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:01,060
Congratulations, Princess Jinxuan.

122
00:06:01,180 --> 00:06:02,940
Congratulations, Zhaoyi Shen.

123
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:12,580
I've copied another painting for Father.

124
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:14,820
May Father enjoy good health,

125
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:15,860
and a prosperous empire.

126
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:20,140
What new painting have you made?

127
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:26,460
Splendid work!

128
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:27,500
Exactly!

129
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:28,460
It's beautiful!

130
00:06:28,460 --> 00:06:30,940
I heard Father has been studying

131
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:32,860
Dunhuang painting lately.

132
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:35,300
So I copied one for you.

133
00:06:35,460 --> 00:06:36,820
On this spring equinox,

134
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:39,540
I present this painting of
Dragon King Worshiping Buddha.

135
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,500
(Consort Qi)
May your wishes be fulfilled,

136
00:06:41,740 --> 00:06:42,780
and people stand with you.

137
00:06:43,060 --> 00:06:44,140
May Buddha's light

138
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,540
bring peace to all.

139
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,160
Zhaoyi Shen has truly taught her well.

140
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,320
(Noble Consort Hui)
The moment Jinxuan speaks,

141
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:52,000
every word is a gem,

142
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,480
every phrase a masterpiece.

143
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:56,920
They say Dunhuang paintings
were made by master artists,

144
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,200
and have been passed down for centuries.

145
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,280
(Concubine Rou)
They're truly rare.

146
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,720
For one so young,

147
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:03,720
to capture the spirit so well

148
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,040
is quite remarkable.

149
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,920
Princess Jinxuan is truly gifted.

150
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,600
No wonder His Majesty favors her

151
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:10,720
(Concubine Jing)
and plans to grant her a title.

152
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,440
Jinxuan.

153
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:15,520
Who taught you to say all that?

154
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:17,680
Your Highness.

155
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:20,200
A few days ago, western tributes

156
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:21,880
presented a rare painting
from Dunhuang as tribute.

157
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,760
His Majesty has been poring over it,

158
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,080
copying it day and night,

159
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:27,840
and is utterly captivated by it.

160
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:28,880
Truly?

161
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,160
Then if my Jinxuan

162
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,560
were to copy a rare Dunhuang painting,

163
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,840
wouldn't she win even more
of His Majesty's favor?

164
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,220
Father, I thought of it myself.

165
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:47,060
Then let me ask you,

166
00:07:47,260 --> 00:07:49,100
why did you choose

167
00:07:49,580 --> 00:07:51,180
this Dragon King Worshiping Buddha?

168
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:53,440
I...

169
00:07:53,780 --> 00:07:55,000
I know

170
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:57,400
Father is the true dragon.

171
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:58,380
So...

172
00:07:58,860 --> 00:07:59,820
I thought

173
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:02,620
seeing the Dragon King I painted

174
00:08:02,860 --> 00:08:04,260
would make you happy.

175
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:10,660
Kneel.

176
00:08:15,020 --> 00:08:16,660
Then if Jinxuan

177
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,100
could copy a rare Dunhuang painting,

178
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,740
wouldn't he favor her even more?

179
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:22,620
Yaoqin, pass on my order.

180
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:24,000
By any means necessary,

181
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,220
spend whatever it takes

182
00:08:25,290 --> 00:08:27,290
to find a Dunhuang painting quickly

183
00:08:27,370 --> 00:08:28,810
for Princess Jinxuan to copy.

184
00:08:28,850 --> 00:08:29,930
Yes, Your Highness.

185
00:08:33,890 --> 00:08:34,490
Lingxi.

186
00:08:34,690 --> 00:08:36,810
Your Father loves painting.

187
00:08:37,130 --> 00:08:40,770
I paid someone
to paint this Dunhuang masterpiece.

188
00:08:40,930 --> 00:08:42,770
If you copy it carefully

189
00:08:42,810 --> 00:08:43,810
and give it to him,

190
00:08:44,170 --> 00:08:46,090
he'll surely be delighted.

191
00:08:48,810 --> 00:08:50,010
Zhaoyi Shen, give it back!

192
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:52,730
Something this precious...

193
00:08:53,650 --> 00:08:54,650
You don't deserve it.

194
00:08:55,690 --> 00:08:57,170
Lingxi, don't...

195
00:08:58,010 --> 00:08:59,250
Lingxi!

196
00:09:00,290 --> 00:09:01,090
Zhaoyi Shen.

197
00:09:01,650 --> 00:09:02,850
It's all for the child.

198
00:09:03,290 --> 00:09:04,370
Please give it back.

199
00:09:04,410 --> 00:09:06,170
I beg you, leave us a way to live.

200
00:09:06,970 --> 00:09:08,210
Save your breath.

201
00:09:08,290 --> 00:09:09,410
A mute girl

202
00:09:09,810 --> 00:09:11,610
wants to outshine my Jinxuan?

203
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:12,930
Dream on!

204
00:09:19,770 --> 00:09:21,170
This Dragon King Worshipping Buddha,

205
00:09:21,370 --> 00:09:22,570
at first glance,

206
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:24,890
depicts the Dragon King
praying devoutly to Buddha.

207
00:09:25,130 --> 00:09:27,370
But its true meaning is

208
00:09:27,850 --> 00:09:29,530
the Dragon King fought his own brother,

209
00:09:29,970 --> 00:09:31,410
killed his kin,

210
00:09:31,410 --> 00:09:35,010
then repented before the Buddha.

211
00:09:38,570 --> 00:09:39,770
(Zhaoyi Shen.)

212
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:42,490
(So you really made Jinxuan
copy this painting.)

213
00:09:43,210 --> 00:09:46,050
(This painting is a grave taboo
to His Majesty.)

214
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:48,890
(You insisted on taking it yourself.)

215
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:51,130
(What utter foolishness.)

216
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:53,850
(Evil always meets its end.)

217
00:09:56,290 --> 00:09:57,250
Forgive her, Your Majesty!

218
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:58,610
Jinxuan is still young.

219
00:09:58,610 --> 00:09:59,650
She's only a child.

220
00:09:59,770 --> 00:10:01,290
She doesn't know any better.

221
00:10:01,570 --> 00:10:03,450
The princess is young and knows nothing,

222
00:10:03,690 --> 00:10:06,090
but the people around me
seem to know everything.

223
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:07,970
Even my recent interests

224
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:09,970
have become common knowledge!

225
00:10:10,890 --> 00:10:12,290
Please calm down, Your Majesty!

226
00:10:12,770 --> 00:10:13,530
Spare my life, Your Majesty!

227
00:10:13,530 --> 00:10:14,250
(Eunuch Liu, Emperor's Personal Eunuch)
I deserve death!

228
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:15,290
I'll investigate at once.

229
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:27,890
Please forgive me, Your Majesty!

230
00:10:28,170 --> 00:10:29,370
I was on duty that day.

231
00:10:29,650 --> 00:10:32,250
I saw Your Majesty receive
the painting from the western tribute.

232
00:10:32,970 --> 00:10:35,770
I hoped the princess
could add to your joy

233
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:37,130
and make you happy.

234
00:10:37,450 --> 00:10:40,730
That's why I told Zhaoyi Shen.

235
00:10:40,850 --> 00:10:41,650
How dare you!

236
00:10:42,010 --> 00:10:43,370
You dare spy on me?

237
00:10:43,650 --> 00:10:44,210
Drag him out!

238
00:10:44,530 --> 00:10:45,050
Beat him to death!

239
00:10:45,930 --> 00:10:46,730
Your Majesty!

240
00:10:47,890 --> 00:10:49,290
Spare me, Your Majesty!

241
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:51,210
Please spare me!

242
00:10:56,210 --> 00:10:57,090
Your Majesty!

243
00:10:58,690 --> 00:10:59,490
By imperial rules,

244
00:10:59,770 --> 00:11:01,730
a princess may receive her title at 10,

245
00:11:01,890 --> 00:11:04,410
when they are expected
to understand proper conduct.

246
00:11:04,970 --> 00:11:07,730
At that age, a child should know
how to behave

247
00:11:08,210 --> 00:11:09,770
and distinguish right from wrong.

248
00:11:09,850 --> 00:11:11,010
But as for her title,

249
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:14,250
let's give Jinxuan more time

250
00:11:14,330 --> 00:11:15,650
to become more sensible.

251
00:11:16,010 --> 00:11:17,450
Yes, Your Majesty.

252
00:11:17,730 --> 00:11:18,530
Zhaoyi Shen,

253
00:11:18,810 --> 00:11:20,770
you bribed palace servants
to learn my intentions.

254
00:11:21,050 --> 00:11:22,050
Your conduct is improper,

255
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:23,330
and failed to raise your child well.

256
00:11:23,770 --> 00:11:24,450
Take her away!

257
00:11:24,730 --> 00:11:25,770
Thirty strokes!

258
00:11:26,210 --> 00:11:26,770
Your Majesty!

259
00:11:27,050 --> 00:11:28,690
Forgive me, Your Majesty!

260
00:11:29,050 --> 00:11:30,650
- I was wrong, Your Majesty!
- Father!

261
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:31,450
I'm innocent!

262
00:11:31,850 --> 00:11:34,370
Someone framed me, Your Majesty!

263
00:11:34,770 --> 00:11:35,930
Your Majesty!

264
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:51,890
This wooden horse is so lifelike.

265
00:11:52,130 --> 00:11:53,690
Who made it for me?

266
00:11:58,890 --> 00:11:59,810
Your Majesty,

267
00:12:00,090 --> 00:12:03,250
this horse was carved by Princess Lingxi

268
00:12:03,490 --> 00:12:06,170
for Your Majesty.

269
00:12:06,690 --> 00:12:07,490
Lingxi?

270
00:12:08,010 --> 00:12:08,810
Your Majesty.

271
00:12:09,210 --> 00:12:12,930
The woman who just spoke is Cairen Rong
from the side hall of Jinghe Palace.

272
00:12:14,770 --> 00:12:15,210
Come on.

273
00:12:18,810 --> 00:12:19,970
Cairen Rong

274
00:12:20,130 --> 00:12:22,450
from the side hall of Jinghe Palace
pay my respects to Your Majesty.

275
00:12:25,410 --> 00:12:28,130
Princess Lingxi
has been clever and deft.

276
00:12:28,610 --> 00:12:30,690
She prepared this gift

277
00:12:30,730 --> 00:12:32,650
to show her love for Your Majesty.

278
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:35,010
This wooden horse is so lifelike.

279
00:12:35,370 --> 00:12:37,570
Such skill at her young age

280
00:12:37,690 --> 00:12:38,570
is truly remarkable.

281
00:12:39,250 --> 00:12:40,450
This horse

282
00:12:40,450 --> 00:12:41,570
looks somewhat familiar.

283
00:12:44,650 --> 00:12:46,690
Your Majesty, Lingxi said

284
00:12:47,010 --> 00:12:49,530
she once heard
the older palace servants say

285
00:12:49,610 --> 00:12:52,330
when Your Majesty was young,

286
00:12:52,330 --> 00:12:54,410
you often rode a fine horse
called Lion's Mane.

287
00:12:54,730 --> 00:12:57,130
Its flowing mane resembled a lion's.

288
00:12:57,450 --> 00:12:59,130
Lingxi remembered the story

289
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:00,210
and kept it in her heart.

290
00:13:00,370 --> 00:13:03,290
She carved this horse
based on their description.

291
00:13:04,890 --> 00:13:05,770
And what is the meaning

292
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:07,290
of this lantern?

293
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:14,610
She often waited along the palace paths,
hoping to see Your Majesty.

294
00:13:15,050 --> 00:13:16,570
She heard the servants say

295
00:13:17,050 --> 00:13:19,970
Your Majesty often work
late into the night reviewing memorials.

296
00:13:20,450 --> 00:13:24,690
She feared Your Majesty might fall
or twist an ankle in the dark,

297
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:27,810
so she made a little lantern

298
00:13:28,250 --> 00:13:30,930
to help Your Majesty
walk safely at night

299
00:13:31,370 --> 00:13:32,850
without having to fear the dark.

300
00:13:36,850 --> 00:13:37,810
This child...

301
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:40,610
She worries
that I might be afraid of the dark

302
00:13:41,290 --> 00:13:42,490
or that I might fall.

303
00:13:46,610 --> 00:13:47,530
Lingxi.

304
00:13:49,250 --> 00:13:50,410
You've grown so much.

305
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:56,490
Come with me.

306
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:07,850
Today is spring equinox.

307
00:14:08,450 --> 00:14:10,490
I've heard much flattery today,

308
00:14:10,810 --> 00:14:11,970
but none of it

309
00:14:12,130 --> 00:14:14,410
moved me as much
as what this child has done.

310
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:16,250
I hereby decree:

311
00:14:16,850 --> 00:14:19,170
Princess Lingxi has shown
outstanding virtue

312
00:14:19,410 --> 00:14:20,410
and a gentle disposition.

313
00:14:20,930 --> 00:14:22,490
She shall be granted the title Jinghe

314
00:14:23,010 --> 00:14:25,970
and a gold longevity lock
set with precious stones,

315
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:28,290
to bring her peace and good fortune

316
00:14:28,650 --> 00:14:29,730
and keep her talents shining.

317
00:14:42,570 --> 00:14:43,770
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

318
00:14:44,010 --> 00:14:46,330
Princess Jinghe is gifted and wise,

319
00:14:46,610 --> 00:14:47,610
with noble bearing.

320
00:14:47,970 --> 00:14:49,570
She is a blessing to the realm,

321
00:14:49,970 --> 00:14:51,130
and a fortune to the state.

322
00:14:52,050 --> 00:14:54,530
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

323
00:14:57,930 --> 00:14:58,730
Your Majesty!

324
00:14:59,330 --> 00:15:00,530
I know I've done wrong.

325
00:15:00,770 --> 00:15:02,130
Please spare me!

326
00:15:02,490 --> 00:15:04,770
I was framed, Your Majesty!

327
00:15:05,490 --> 00:15:07,570
I swear I won't do it again!

328
00:15:09,690 --> 00:15:11,490
(Who would've thought, Cairen Rong...)

329
00:15:11,890 --> 00:15:15,170
(Even you want to join the battle
for His Majesty's favor.)

330
00:15:24,770 --> 00:15:29,250
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

331
00:15:29,690 --> 00:15:34,290
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

332
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:39,090
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

333
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:43,930
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

334
00:15:44,210 --> 00:15:48,690
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

335
00:15:49,130 --> 00:15:53,730
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

336
00:15:53,930 --> 00:15:58,530
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

337
00:15:58,890 --> 00:16:03,490
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

338
00:16:03,650 --> 00:16:08,250
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

339
00:16:08,530 --> 00:16:11,810
♪Let stars and sea♪

340
00:16:11,810 --> 00:16:13,130
(Changsheng Gate)

341
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:17,100
♪Wait for your return♪
